  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 0.2.2\n\n- Align the package version with the hosted authoring validation release; contract generation and publication behavior are unchanged.\n\n## 0.2.1\n\n- Add a producer client that publishes new versions of owned contracts and returns the server's compatibility verdict.\n- Keep publication independent of host frameworks and of the application's HTTP handler configuration.\n- Align the package version with the Echo package release and include NuGet release notes and symbols.\n\n## 0.1.1\n\n- Provide the shared contract document codec, validation, inference and deterministic generation engine.",
